  core-only P7 strings: ['語言 · Language focus', '語言聚焦 · 三個級別，三個主題 · Three levels, three topics', 'A2 · 展會的話 · Fair words', "This week's fairs give you four useful", 'words: 旅展 (travel fair), 攤位 (booth),', '集章 (stamp-collecting) and 吉祥物大遊行', '(mascot parade). Learn them once, and', 'the whole travel fair makes sense.', 'Four fair words: 旅展， 攤位， 集章，', '吉祥物大遊行.', '旅展 is short for 旅行展覽會 (travel', 'exhibition). A 攤位 is one stall inside the', 'fair; the Taipei fair has 1,600 of them.', '集章 means collecting stamps at set', 'points — collect all six Greenway stamps', 'and you win a prize.', 'Fill in', "Practise: 「旅展幾點開門？」 ('What time", "does the fair open?') — Friday opens at", 'noon, other days at 10:00.']
