  core-only: ['語言 · Language focus', '語言聚焦 · 三個級別，三個主題 · Three levels, three topics', 'A2 · 展會的話 · Fair words', "This week's fairs give you four useful", 'words: 旅展 (travel fair), 攤位 (booth),', '集章 (stamp-collecting) and 吉祥物大遊行', '(mascot parade). Learn them once, and', 'the whole travel fair makes sense.', 'Four fair words: 旅展， 攤位， 集章，', '吉祥物大遊行.', '旅展 is short for 旅行展覽會 (travel', 'exhibition). A 攤位 is one stall inside the', 'fair; the Taipei fair has 1,600 of them.', '集章 means collecting stamps at set', 'points — collect all six Greenway stamps', 'and you win a prize.', 'Fill in', "Practise: 「旅展幾點開門？」 ('What time", "does the fair open?') — Friday opens at", 'noon, other days at 10:00.', 'B1 · 球賽與節氣 · Games & seasons', "Sport and seasons share this week's", 'headlines. Group the words and they', 'stick: winning （封王、完封） and winter', '（立冬、進補）.', 'Group the words: winning （封王/完封）,', 'winter （立冬/進補）.', '封王 means clinching the championship;', '完封 means shutting the other side out, 0', 'runs. 立冬 is the solar term that starts', 'winter; 進補 is eating nourishing hot food', 'before the cold months.', 'Memory trick: learn 封王 first, then the', 'way it was won （完封）, then the season', 'it happened in （立冬）.', 'B2 · 港台說法 · Local talk', 'Taiwan and Hong Kong each have their', 'own way of saying things. This week:', '打卡 (check in with a photo), 討糖', '(trick-or-treat), 踩街 (street parade in', 'costume) and 泡湯 (soak in a hot spring).', 'Four local words from this issue: 打卡，', '討糖， 踩街， 泡湯.', '打卡 started as clocking in at work, but at', 'a fair or festival it means posting a photo', "to say 'I was here'. 討糖 is what children", 'say at shops at Halloween; 踩街 is the', 'costumed parade itself; 泡湯 is the', 'autumn pleasure of a hot-spring bath.', "You don't need many local sayings —", 'learn four and every outing feels closer.', '易錯診所 · Error clinic', '完勝 means winning big; 完封 means the', 'other side scored zero.', 'Lidong starts winter; the Solstice is the', 'shortest day. Different terms.', 'Check the city: FinTech Week opens in', 'Hong Kong, not Taipei.', '本週句式 · Sentence frame', '「先去集章，再去看表演。」 — the', 'frame 先…再… gives the order of two', 'actions: first X, then Y. Make your', 'own: 先比價，再結帳 (compare prices', 'first, then pay).', 'Frame: 先…再… — first X, then Y. Make', 'your own sentence with it.', "讀者園地 · Readers' corner", "An editor's example letter — not a real", 'one. Deferral notice: VOL.1 promised real', 'letters and best page-8 writing from this', 'issue; none publishable had arrived by', 'press time, so the example stays and the', 'invitation stays open.', "本週金句 · Phrases of the week — word for word from this issue's", 'Pay by phone, scan to pay, buy insurance online — that is fi', '123 countries and cities, 1,600 booths. (p. 1)', "Buy what you need; don't buy a pile of things you won't use ", 'In Kaohsiung, even steel can become a stage. (p. 3)', "Fulong's summer came to an end on October 26. (p. 3)", 'A 6-0 shutout of the Brothers, and the Dragons threw the red', '250 shops giving treats together. (p. 5)', "On the fair's first day the doors open only at noon. (p. 6)", '下期預告 · Next week (VOL.3)', 'Lucerna · 繁體中文週報 VOL.2 · 繁體中文正文 · 英語講解 · Traditional Chinese', '第 7 版 / 共 8 版']
  ed-only (first 30): ['語言 · ことばの焦点', '語言聚焦 · 三個級別，三個主題 · 3つのレベル、3つのテーマ', 'A2 · 展會的話 · 展示会のことば', '今週の展示会から、役立つ言葉を4つ紹介す', 'る：旅展（旅行展覧会）、攤位（ブース）、', '集章（スタンプ集め）、吉祥物大遊行（マス', 'コットパレード）。一度覚えれば、旅展全体', 'が理解できる。', '展示会の言葉4つ：旅展、攤位、集章、吉祥物', '大遊行。', '旅展は旅行展覽會（旅行展覧会）の略。攤位', 'は展示会の中の一つの出店で、台北の旅展に', 'は1,600もある。集章は決められた場所でス', 'タンプを集めることで、6つのグリーンウェ', 'イのスタンプを全部集めると賞品がもらえ', 'る。', '空所補充', '練習：「旅展幾點開門？」（旅展は何時に開', 'きますか）— 金曜日は正午開場、他の日は10', '時開場。', 'B1 · 球賽與節氣 · 試合と季節', 'スポーツと季節が今週の見出しを分け合って', 'いる。言葉をグループにすると覚えやすい：', '勝利（封王、完封）と冬（立冬、進補）。', '言葉をグループに：勝利（封王／完封）、冬', '（立冬／進補）。', '封王は優勝を決めること、完封は相手を無得', '点に抑えること（0点）。立冬は冬を始める', '節気、進補は寒い季節の前に体に良い温かい', 'ものを食べること。']
